WHAT THIS COVERS

The licence above applies to the source code of this project: everything in
src/, bin/, docs/, install.mjs, and the configuration and documentation files.

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ARTWORK.

The sprites in assets/ are not mine to license and are not MIT. They are
included so the project works when cloned, under what is normally treated as
fan use. See ATTRIBUTION.md for what came from where.

If you are reusing this project, the code is yours to take freely. The sprites
are not — bring your own, or fetch them yourself, which is what `npm run roster`
already does for most of them.
